msgstr "Unbekannter Fehler beim Hochladen des Standard-Templates."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:289
msgid "Unknown error while uploading."
msgstr "Unbekannter Fehler beim Hochladen."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:294
msgid "A name for the new template was given, but no file was selected."
msgstr "Name für das neue Template angegeben, aber keine Datei ausgewählt."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:300
msgid ""
"Please enter a name for the new template (required) - the file was therefore "
"not saved."
msgstr ""
"Bitte einen Namen für das neue Template vergeben (Pflichtfeld) - die Datei "
"wurde deshalb nicht übernommen."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:321
msgid ""
"Forms are enabled, but no recipient email address has been set - the form "
"handler will reject incoming submissions until this is fixed."
msgstr ""
"Formulare sind aktiviert, aber es ist keine Empfänger-E-Mail-Adresse "
"hinterlegt - der Formular-Handler lehnt eingehende Nachrichten bis dahin ab."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:339
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The form \"thank you\" page points to your WordPress domain (%s). With "
"Netlify as the target, the form would then submit DIRECTLY to WordPress "
"instead of Netlify - the submission would never show up in Netlify's Forms "
"overview. Please leave it empty or enter a relative address on the Netlify "
"site itself (e.g. /thank-you/)."
msgstr ""
"Die \"Danke-Seite\" bei Formularen zeigt auf deine WordPress-Domain (%s). "
"Bei Netlify als Ziel würde das Formular dann DIREKT an WordPress senden "
"statt an Netlify - die Einreichung würde nie in Netlifys Forms-Übersicht "
"erscheinen. Bitte leer lassen oder eine relative Adresse auf der Netlify-"
"Site selbst eintragen (z.B. /danke/)."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:371
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The request exceeds the server limit post_max_size (currently: %s). The file "
"is too large to upload in this form."
msgstr ""
"Die Anfrage überschreitet das Server-Limit post_max_size (aktuell: %s). "
"Datei ist zu groß für einen Upload in diesem Formular."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:412
msgid "Export failed:"
msgstr "Export fehlgeschlagen:"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:416
msgid "Export failed: the ZIP file was not created."
msgstr "Export fehlgeschlagen: ZIP-Datei wurde nicht erzeugt."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:440
msgid "Generate automatically"
msgstr "Automatisch generieren"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:444
msgid "Replace navigation markers in the template with real menu items"
msgstr "Navigations-Marker im Template durch echte Menüpunkte ersetzen"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:449
msgid "WordPress menu"
msgstr "WordPress-Menü"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:452
msgid "Select a menu"
msgstr "Menü wählen"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:460
msgid "No menus found - create one first under Appearance → Menus."
msgstr "Keine Menüs gefunden - unter Design → Menüs zunächst eines anlegen."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:465
msgid "Wrapper marker"
msgstr "Wrapper-Marker"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:468
msgid "Wraps the ENTIRE menu area in the template (e.g. the outer <ul>)."
msgstr ""
"Umschließt den GESAMTEN Menü-Bereich im Template (z.B. das äußere <ul>)."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:472
msgid "Item marker"
msgstr "Item-Marker"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:475
msgid ""
"Wraps EXACTLY ONE demo menu item without sub-items (e.g. one <li>) - "
"duplicated for each real menu item."
msgstr ""
"Umschließt GENAU EINEN Demo-Menüpunkt ohne Unterpunkte (z.B. ein <li>) - "
"wird pro echtem Menüpunkt vervielfältigt."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:479
msgid "Parent item marker (optional)"
msgstr "Parent-Item-Marker (optional)"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:482
msgid ""
"Only needed for multi-level menus. Without this marker, sub-items are "
"ignored (flat display)."
msgstr ""
"Nur nötig für mehrstufige Menüs. Ohne diesen Marker werden Unterpunkte "
"ignoriert (flache Darstellung)."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:486
msgid "Submenu wrapper marker"
msgstr "Submenu-Wrapper-Marker"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:489
msgid ""
"Only relevant if \"Parent item marker\" is set - wraps the container for sub-"
"items INSIDE the parent template."
msgstr ""
"Nur relevant, wenn \"Parent-Item-Marker\" gesetzt ist - umschließt INNERHALB "
"der Parent-Vorlage den Container für die Unterpunkte."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:493
msgid "Submenu item marker (optional)"
msgstr "Submenu-Item-Marker (optional)"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:496
msgid "Leave empty to use the same template as \"Item marker\" for sub-items."
msgstr ""
"Leer lassen, um für Unterpunkte dieselbe Vorlage wie \"Item-Marker\" zu "
"verwenden."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:513
#, php-format
msgid ""
"The file exceeds the server limit upload_max_filesize (currently: %s). "
"Please shrink the ZIP or ask your host to raise the limit."
msgstr ""
"Die Anfrage überschreitet das Server-Limit post_max_size (aktuell: %s). "
"Datei ist zu groß für einen Upload in diesem Formular."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:517
msgid "The file exceeds the maximum allowed by the form."
msgstr "Die Datei überschreitet das im Formular erlaubte Maximum."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:519
msgid "The file was only partially uploaded. Please try again."
msgstr "Die Datei wurde nur teilweise hochgeladen. Bitte erneut versuchen."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:521
msgid "Server error: no temporary directory available for uploads."
msgstr "Server-Fehler: Kein temporäres Verzeichnis für Uploads vorhanden."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:523
msgid "Server error: the file could not be written to disk."
msgstr ""
"Server-Fehler: Datei konnte nicht auf die Festplatte geschrieben werden."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:525
msgid "The upload was stopped by a PHP extension."
msgstr "Der Upload wurde durch eine PHP-Erweiterung gestoppt."

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:529
#, php-format
msgid "Unknown upload error (code %d)."
msgstr "Unbekannter Upload-Fehler (Code %d)."

