msgstr "Kein"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:604
msgid "found in"
msgstr "gefunden in"

#: includes/class-wpstatic-settings.php:605
msgid ""
"Secrets are still stored encrypted, but with an auto-generated key that also "
